Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Salesman ke liye ek alag simplified dashboard hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Login karte hi aapko sirf apne customers, apne target, aur apne beat dikhte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My Sales — is month kitna kiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My Target — kitna reach karna hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My Customers — poori list, filter aur search ke saath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My Beat — is week kis kis ko visit karna hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner ka poora data nahi dikhta — sirf aapka apna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean, focused, aur phone pe fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Field mein use karne ke liye perfect.
